# The emitted scanner numbers its states with a u16: a minimized DFA over
# 65535 states is an error ("an 'a' 15 bytes before the 'c'" needs 65541)
# error: lexer_dfa_too_large.grammar:9:1:
# error: the lexer DFA has 65541 states; at most 65535 are supported
@lexer
tokens
    t, eof, err

[ab]* 'a' [ab]{15} 'c'  → t
.                       → err

@parser
top! = ERR → 1
